menuconfig DRIVERS_DISTANCE_SENSOR_TOF_SENSE_MS
	bool "tof_sense_ms"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for the Nooploop TOFSense / TOFSense-F / TOFSense-S and
		TOFSense-M / TOFSense-MS laser range finders (NLink UART protocol).

		The driver streams frames from a serial port, validates the NLink
		checksum, reduces the 8x8 zone map of the M/MS series to a single
		distance and publishes it on the distance_sensor uORB topic.
